  (text "5 V in feeds VSYS through D1 - the datasheet's own arrangement:" (at 71.12 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a4f71a80-8ab2-50a7-a653-3a4adbd2e6f2"))
  (text "it keeps USB and the external supply from fighting when both are" (at 71.12 21.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b44d61cf-60f2-557f-94ae-f7e8298cf86d"))
  (text "plugged in. C1 22 uF / 16 V is the bulk that goes with it." (at 71.12 25.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5e0a65b9-ac0f-5a96-a029-f20d5d1a1a55"))
  (text "C2 bypasses the module's own 3.3 V;" (at 172.72 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ea6ee9bf-cab4-53d7-b5d8-30784048960a"))
  (text "D3 says that rail is up." (at 172.72 42.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "01f5427a-a715-530c-ac71-c9d8c6775395"))
  (text "Every module pin goes 1:1 to the header beside it, as names:" (at 20.32 146.05 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "30d43697-66ac-5c60-b4c3-1b10c09c64cc"))
  (text "the pair of labels at each pin is the mapping. J4 counts down" (at 20.32 150.05 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f0888df3-d0b7-56ec-b555-4dc29b5496e2"))
  (text "against the module - the Pico numbers its right side from the" (at 20.32 154.05 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ea036d27-683e-5e43-8651-8350499e6e16"))
  (text "bottom, a header from the top." (at 20.32 158.05 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3f2730c5-366c-5e22-bac5-c6dfc2f6107e"))
  (text "AGND goes to the header on its own: the module" (at 165.1 146.05 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "dba39fc6-d770-5365-9df1-f9dd3fca8dac"))
  (text "already joins it to GND inside, and joining it" (at 165.1 150.05 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cb656a00-31bb-5d32-ba1d-430f3d0986f3"))
  (text "again here is two power outputs wired together." (at 165.1 154.05 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1d765022-5381-5697-81dd-ad73dc2934f9"))
  (text "The back plane necessarily opens under the module's two" (at 165.1 160.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1de42dbb-51c4-5639-9dae-05e9cf7c472f"))
  (text "pin rows: forty through-holes at 2.54 mm leave no copper" (at 165.1 164.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e3423fed-84e5-53d2-befc-a92f54ea80dd"))
  (text "between them. It is continuous around and between the rows." (at 165.1 168.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bb2a657e-c5c1-531b-8479-31b4726563df"))
